     Peaceful monsters only make them themselves invisible
when you're able to see invisible.  Prior to entering the shop,
you drank a potion of see invisible.  The shopkeeper is an
item-using monster, so has a chance to start with a random item
that's usable for offensive, defensive, or miscellaneous purposes,
above and beyond the stuff he gets as a shopkeeper.  His extra
item happened to be a potion of invisibility, and he drank it.
After your own potion timed out, you couldn't see him any more.

